{"sba-keyaki-14396":{"blocks":[{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":" \n こんばんは ✩︎⡱\n \n \n \n 最近、丸山純奈さんの『ドラマ』を聴いてぽろぽろ泣いています。\n \n \n \n \n \n \n \n \n \n \n \n \n …なんでだろう。\n 何回聴いても泣けるんですよね。\n \n \n \n 中学2年生ということにも驚きだし\n ストレートな歌詞とまっすぐな歌声に心を打たれます。\n \n \n \n お母さんっ子な私にとって\n すごく共感できる歌詞で、いつかお母さんに歌いたいな〜と思いながら\n \n \n \n イメトレしたらもう大号泣☺️☺️\n \n \n \n \n 年々、涙脆くなっています。笑\n \n \n \n \n 皆さん絶対に聴いてください!!!\n 丸山純奈さんの『ドラマ』\n \n \n \n \n \n \n \n \n \n \n \n 私は中学2年生のときなにしてたっけな〜\n \n \n \n \n \n 覚えてないや😚\n \n \n "},{"type":"image","src":"https://images.sakamichi.co/blogs/01JHYKGVCEYF1NM5HP3A3X2F1T","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":">\n  \n  \n  \n またね ◡̈⃝︎⋆︎*"}],"source":"archive"},"crw-nogi-9513":{"blocks":[{"type":"paragraph","text":"こんにちはヽ(・∀・)ノ"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"2012年...*\nあっという間の1年間でした。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"乃木坂46に入って\n辛いこと、嬉しいこと、\n悔しい気持ち、感謝の気持ち...\n沢山のことを経験しました。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"その中で、日奈なりに日奈のペースで成長してきた日々。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"今まで頑張ることができたのも、\nひなちまふぁみりーの存在があったからです+*"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"今こうしてブログを読んで下さっている、ふぁみりーさん1人1人が日奈の大きな支えです('-'*)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"みなさん\nいつもありがとうございます＊"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"これからもずっと\n日奈の傍にいてほしいです(*´ω｀*)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/hina.higuchi/img/files/46/_pre/blog/hina.higuchi/img/2012/12/31/3542917/0000.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"↑裏原で買った上着だよ♪\n昨日から長野県にあるおじいちゃん、おばあちゃんのお家に来てるんだ〜(^^)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"雪が積もっていて\nちょっぴり寒いよ*"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/hina.higuchi/img/files/46/_pre/blog/hina.higuchi/img/2012/12/31/3542917/0001.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"今日12月31日はひなちまふぁみりーさんの中に2人お誕生日の方がいますo(^o^)o"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"☆Happy Birthday☆"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"2013年も良い年になりますように...＊"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/hina.higuchi/img/files/46/_pre/blog/hina.higuchi/img/2012/12/31/3542917/0002.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"2012年のブログはこれでおわり!＊"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"次からのブログは2013年のブログになります(^o^)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"みなさん2012年ありがとうございましたぁー(*^O^*)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"これからもよろしくお願いします!"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"大好き"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"日奈"}],"source":"archive"},"sba-keyaki-17502":{"blocks":[{"type":"paragraph","text":"こんにちは🍊"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ポートメッセなごやの\n全国握手会、個別握手会に\n来てくださった皆さん\nありがとうございました✨✨"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://images.sakamichi.co/blogs/01JHYMP9MF0G6W5NHS150FAQCT","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":">"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"インスタ映えな背景だった(笑)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://images.sakamichi.co/blogs/01JHYMPAN9T4RQWW5WAVEMBC1V","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":">"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"理佐さんと撮りました🍓"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://images.sakamichi.co/blogs/01JHYMPBMRNTCHQ6KD9Z8FXRB0","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":">"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://images.sakamichi.co/blogs/01JHYMPCMKZQV2XKVMWRQDC9NP","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":">"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"お花もありがとーう💕"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"次のブログでお花の写真また載せます☺️"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"次はパシフィコ横浜で会いましょーう🍒"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"なな"}],"source":"archive"},"sba-hinata-30015":{"blocks":[{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":" \n こんばちは\n \n \n 私はハマりやすいし影響されやすいです。\n \n 今は自分のことをゴミだと思っている\n フォーキーが大好きです🥺🥺\n トイストーリー4、とってもお勧めです、、。\n \n \n 佐々木久美です。\n \n 今日はパシフィコ横浜で\n 8th「黒い羊」最後の握手会でした！\n 欅坂46さんと一緒なのも最後で\n なんだか実感のないまま終わってしまいました、、。\n \n もう一緒にならないと思うと\n 悲しいです、、。\n \n でも沢山写真撮りました💗\n \n \n "},{"type":"image","src":"https://images.sakamichi.co/blogs/01JJ34H1N5J4MKVV7ACD3QQDJS","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":">\n  \n  \n りささんの生誕祭で\n お花を渡す役割をいただきました！\n 本当に嬉しかったです💗\n でもとっても緊張しました😭\n \n 重要な役割をくださり、\n ありがとうございました！\n \n \n "},{"type":"image","src":"https://images.sakamichi.co/blogs/01JJ34H2NAPXQV8J6EVY89DPJB","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":">\n "},{"type":"image","src":"https://images.sakamichi.co/blogs/01JJ34H3PGXGC83X496G4M9P6W","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":">\n "},{"type":"image","src":"https://images.sakamichi.co/blogs/01JJ34H4QJ5ZCEY3YVBY9RM1BW","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":">\n "},{"type":"image","src":"https://images.sakamichi.co/blogs/01JJ34H5PW0K2M5HK3VK2BCJ5G","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":">\n  \n  \n  \n 花束を渡すと聞いた時のきくちゃんです。\n \n ①驚く\n ②喜ぶ\n ③喜びを噛み締めて泣く\n ④お礼をする\n \n 以上の流れです。\n お納めください。\n \n \n \n "},{"type":"image","src":"https://images.sakamichi.co/blogs/01JJ34H6QKR8TCRTH2B5BGT89X","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":">\n  \n  \n もりねえと天ちゃん💗\n \n "},{"type":"image","src":"https://images.sakamichi.co/blogs/01JJ34H7N1KVK65CYNVR89KDGM","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":">\n "},{"type":"image","src":"https://images.sakamichi.co/blogs/01JJ34H8YCKFK22EYVT9B3XZRK","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":">\n \n \n "},{"type":"image","src":"https://images.sakamichi.co/blogs/01JJ34H9Z58J3EH50NVDD5KSDB","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":">\n  \n  \n 親戚の集まりみたいになりました（笑）\n \n 天ちゃんときくちゃんは\n 10歳離れていました😭😭😭\n \n \n \n "},{"type":"image","src":"https://images.sakamichi.co/blogs/01JJ34HAWPGQT9QPJ1FYNGFGV8","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":">\n  \n  \n  \n 仲良くなりたかったから\n 嬉しいです。🦒\n \n \n \n \n そうです。\n この日は浴衣きました🎆\n \n 「花火行こうね」というテーマでした。\n \n \n "},{"type":"image","src":"https://images.sakamichi.co/blogs/01JJ34HBWTQJ082Y8N8J945N77","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":">\n "},{"type":"image","src":"https://images.sakamichi.co/blogs/01JJ34HCX9R92HHXQGMY0N4RMZ","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":">\n "},{"type":"image","src":"https://images.sakamichi.co/blogs/01JJ34HDZTNZZPBXRXYC8DT8M7","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":">\n  \n  \n  \n  \n まだまだ今年の夏は浴衣着る予定です！\n お楽しみに〜〜🧞‍♀️\n \n \n \n 午前1:29〜「HINABINGO!4」が始まります！\n みんな浴衣です！みてね〜☺️☺️\n \n \n ではまたね( ˙-˙ )/\n \n 佐々木久美"}],"source":"archive"},"crw-nogi-24218":{"blocks":[{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/miria.watanabe/img/miria.watanabe/img/2015/06/24/3581220/0000.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"こないだ二日間お休みだったので"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"家族で静岡に行ってきました〜！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"朝はドライブ気分で車に乗って"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"スヤスヤ寝てたら3時間後には静岡に着いてて"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"何事かとおもった。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ナンテコッタ"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"熱海行って伊豆高原行って箱根行って..."},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"でも雨だったのがちょっと残念だった(+_+)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"観光地巡りが好きなのを親は知ってるので"},{"type":"br